review.md must cite concrete patch sections and the commands used. It must include these exact lines when warranted: `Verdict: PASS`, `Readiness: REVIEWED_PATCH_READY_TO_APPLY`, `Changed file: RUNBOOK_COMPETITIVE_ANALYSIS.md`, `Scoring formulas changed: no`, `External-action authority changed: no`, `No fatal, material, or minor issues`, and `Patch may be applied for human review`. If any real issue exists, set verdict FAIL and state it plainly rather than making the check pass. Use no em dashes.
